import pathlib,json,random
R=pathlib.Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1];N={n['id']:n for n in json.loads((R/'data/notes.json').read_text())}
rows='''1~Which sequence preserves publication chronology?~January parliamentary opening and Survey; February Union Budget.~January Union Budget followed by December Survey.|All Budget Session events occurred in January.|The Survey itself appropriates expenditure.
2~The Survey’s 6.8%–7.2% range refers to:~A FY2026–27 projection, not the FY2025–26 advance estimate.~The final measured FY2025–26 outcome.|A fixed guaranteed quarterly rate.|The percentage-point repo reduction.
3~January’s 7.4% GDP figure is:~A first advance estimate subject to revision.~An audited final outturn.|The same figure as GVA by definition.|Proof every sector grew 7.4%.
4~Positive CPI and negative WPI inflation can coexist because:~Their baskets and coverage differ.~One must always be fabricated.|All retail prices equal wholesale prices.|They necessarily use identical weights and products.
5~Effective capital expenditure includes:~Specified grants for creation of capital assets as well as direct capital expenditure.~Only every cash transfer regardless of purpose.|Only interest payments.|No grants under any condition.
6~Over 99% in the EU announcement refers to:~Indian export trade-value coverage, not automatic identical tariff-line share.~Every product immediately entering duty-free in January.|An unrestricted exemption from standards.|Guaranteed export growth of 99%.
7~The EU FTA’s CBAM cooperation should not be read as:~An automatically complete exemption from carbon-border requirements.~A subject for technical engagement.|Relevant to emissions verification.|A reason to examine exporter compliance capacity.
8~An LNG agreement starting in 2028 establishes:~Future contracted supply, not January 2026 deliveries.~All agreed supply already delivered.|A grant of free energy to every household.|A completed domestic power plant.
9~Visa-free transit is distinct from:~Unrestricted entry and employment throughout Europe.~An airport-travel facilitation arrangement.|A subject requiring operative eligibility checks.|A mobility-related announcement.
10~Industrial-design protection principally concerns:~Visual appearance rather than automatically protecting every technical function.~Every technical invention as a patent.|A universal monopoly over any interface idea.|An enacted virtual-design amendment merely from a concept note.
11~The January UGC equity position was:~2026 implementation stayed, with the reviewed 2012 framework continuing.~Every 2026 obligation unconditionally in force.|Final abolition of every anti-discrimination duty.|A final merits verdict solely from an interim stay.
12~A mental-health support-centre announcement proves:~A framework, not that every campus has trained services or no future crisis.~Every student received clinical care.|Confidential data can be published without limits.|No referral capacity is necessary.
13~Pesticide registration and licensing differ because:~Product assessment and permission for specified activities are distinct functions.~Either automatically authorises every use forever.|The draft repealed the old law immediately.|Seed and pesticide regulation are identical.
15~An MMDR draft removing area limits implies:~A proposed statutory change, not a waiver of all permissions.~Immediate authority to mine every forest area.|A fully operational mine at publication.|No role for final legislation or lease conditions.
16~Partial lease execution:~Does not itself clear the remaining forest land.~Automatically grants all forest permissions.|Applies without any mineral-specific conditions.|Proves cumulative impacts need not be assessed.
17~Environmental-penalty earmarking should be evaluated through:~Actual accountable monitoring/remediation outcomes.~Only the size of receipts collected.|A guaranteed equal payment to every citizen.|An assumption pollution became permissible once penalised.
18~The new SWM framework’s stated start date is:~1 April 2026, distinct from January notification.~Every provision operational on 1 January.|A permanent urban-only framework.|No defined transition because notification and commencement always coincide.
19~Alternative bulk-generator thresholds mean:~Falling below one threshold does not necessarily avoid coverage under another.~All listed thresholds must always be met cumulatively.|Residential societies are automatically excluded.|Only waste weight can ever determine coverage.
20~A continuing Consent to Operate is:~Still subject to conditions and cancellation, not immunity.~Permission to pollute without limit.|The same instrument as every environmental clearance.|Proof inspections are abolished.
21~Falling emissions intensity with rising output can mean:~Absolute emissions still increase.~Absolute emissions must fall by the same percentage.|Output no longer matters.|All facilities become net zero automatically.
23~Research-drug online intimation is not:~Automatic permission for unrestricted commercial sale.~A simplified specified research route.|Distinct from commercial approval.|Subject to the scope and exceptions of the rules.
24~The UCB discussion paper should be treated as:~Consultation, not proof new licences were issued.~An automatic licence to every cooperative society.|A universal deposit guarantee equal to proposed capital.|Final abolition of governance requirements.
25~APY extension means:~Continued contributory pension support with pension from age sixty, not immediate ₹5,000 to everyone.~A new AP-specific unconditional cash scheme.|Every subscriber receives the maximum pension immediately.|Contributions no longer matter.
26~Half of the specified outstanding-merit athlete representatives being women means:~A rule for that representation category, not necessarily half of every body’s entire membership.~Exactly half of all federation posts automatically.|Only two total members in every general body.|Exactly four members with no possibility of more.
28~Delimitation after 2026 should not be interpreted as:~Automatic nationwide seat redistribution on 1 January 2026.~A constitutional and statutory process.|Relevant to federal representation debates.|Dependent on the applicable census/publication conditions.
29~A split verdict on Section 17A means:~No single majority disposition can be invented from opposing opinions.~The provision was unanimously finally struck down.|The provision was unanimously finally upheld.|Investigation approval and prosecution sanction are identical.
32~EPI2024 published in 2026 measures:~Composite preparedness, not simply total export value.~Only physical export volume.|A final causal estimate of one state policy.|A methodology unchanged by definition across editions.
33~CPI rebasing requires distinguishing:~Reference month, weight survey, classification and publication date.~January data from every later release as if all appeared in January.|Every food-weight percentage as like-for-like despite classification changes.|Index rebasing from a guaranteed fall in cost of living.
39~APLINC and AP Logistics Fund are:~Distinct proposed institutional vehicles; approval does not prove fundraising or construction.~One universal cash grant.|Proof every infrastructure asset is complete.|Identical to a project-specific launch licence.
42~Aerospace land allotment establishes:~A project-stage approval, not certified production or a successful launch.~An operational spaceport by definition.|Automatic aircraft type certification.|No need for later project permissions.'''
Q=[]
for line in rows.splitlines():
 idx,text,correct,wrong=line.split('~');ref='E8-2601-'+idx.zfill(3);n=N[ref];o=[correct]+wrong.split('|');random.Random(ref).shuffle(o)
 Q.append(dict(id='JAN26-'+f'{len(Q)+1:02}',question=text,options=o,answer=o.index(correct),explanation=n['static_link']+' '+n['analysis'][0]+' Caution: '+n['trap'],ref=ref))
assert len(Q)==30
(R/'data/2026-01-mcqs.json').write_text(json.dumps(Q,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
F=[(5,'Trace recurrent commitments, guarantees and capital-grant outcomes, rather than use accounting labels alone','Service outcomes and medium-term debt/fiscal flexibility'),(6,'Combine tariff-origin guidance, sanitary compliance, emissions records and finance for smaller firms','Preference utilisation and durable market diversification, not treaty headlines'),(11,'Clear definitions, accessible complaints and fair reasoned decisions alongside compliance with court orders','Inclusion and trusted redress without assuming a stayed rule is operative'),(12,'Trained staff, confidential referrals, crisis protocols and continuity with district services','Access and follow-up without exposing personally identifiable health information'),(18,'Costed local plans, segregation, reliable collection, processing markets and worker protection','Verified waste diversion and safe treatment rather than installed capacity alone'),(24,'Capital quality, member governance, competent boards and technology/cyber support','Financial inclusion with asset quality and depositor protection'),(30,'Network mapping, independent quality sampling, pressure integrity and rapid public warnings','Safe reliable delivered water, not only connections'),(39,'Separate sponsor, fund manager and project roles with transparent procurement and risk disclosure','Funds actually raised, projects delivered and contingent exposure reported')]
lines=['# January 2026 · Eight original Mains frameworks','','Original planning aids, not official answers or exam predictions. Historical source claims and proposals need current-status checks.']
for idx,design,metric in F:
 n=N['E8-2601-'+str(idx).zfill(3)];lines+=['','## '+n['mains'],'','**Study reference:** '+n['id'],'','**Opening distinction:** '+n['static_link'],'','**Dated anchor:** '+n['facts'][0]+' '+n['facts'][1],'','**Main argument:** '+n['analysis'][0],'','**Counterpoint / evidence limit:** '+n['trap'],'','**Implementation priorities:** '+design+'.','','**Evaluation criterion:** '+metric+'.','','**Linkage / AP application:** '+n['analysis'][1],'','**Suggested answer plan:** Define the mechanism, cite the dated anchor, develop two benefits and two constraints, name accountable implementing institutions, and conclude with the evaluation criterion. Keep court stays, consultations and commencement stages explicit.']
(R/'volumes/January-2026-Mains-Frameworks.md').write_text('\n'.join(lines)+'\n')
print('Created January 2026 practice: 30 MCQs / 8 frameworks, separate from January 2025')
